{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>His inheritance to his kinsman</b> — letters of נחלת שארו לו, and שארו means only his wife. And this is what the Sages said: they subtract and add and expound. Explanation: they subtract the vav from נחלתו and add it to the lamed of לשארו, and there remains לו — hence נחלת שארו לו, and they expound: the inheritance of his שאר, who is his wife, belongs לו. And this is what the Sages said: that the husband inherits his wife."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:16.441847116Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}